   </table><p style="margin-left:3.333%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:2.7pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:3.407%;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Yeah. And just like Emily said, no matter AI in compute or industrial, we do see this kind of market segment will continue to grow next year and even year after next year. And at same time, we continue to introduce our new products into this segment and these new products, usually we can get much better GP on that. So, that's really where we're going to put our R&amp;D focus on that, but continually to grow our GP percent in the future.</font></p><p style="margin-left:3.653%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0.7pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#a6a6a6;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">.....................................................................................................................................................................................................................................................................</font></p>
